# Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# Read by netlify/functions/bgg.ts, which proxies the BoardGameGeek XML API. BGG requires an
# Authorization header on every request: https://boardgamegeek.com/using_the_xml_api
#
# Deliberately no VITE_ prefix — that prefix is what tells Vite to inline a value into the client
# bundle, which would hand the token to every visitor. This one is only ever read on the server.
#
# Serving the function locally needs `npx netlify dev` rather than `npm run dev`.
BGG_AUTH_TOKEN=
